{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And the festival of harvest.</b> First fruits of the wheat harvest. Now the festival of matzot will always be in it, in the aviv, which is the first fruits of the barley. The interval between the first fruits of barley and the first fruits of wheat is like \"seven weeks you shall count for yourself\" (ibid.)." "<b>And the festival of ingathering at the going out of the year.</b> And another year enters, and the beginning for sowing is from Marcheshvan."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:37.772026127Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}